    {
      "heading": "② 可以一項一項積",
      "body": [
        "微分是線性的：$(aF+bG)'=aF'+bG'$。倒過來：",
        "$a$、$b$ 是常數；各項的常數合併成一個 $C$",
        "為什麼對？把右邊微分：$aF'+bG'=af+bg$，正好是左邊的被積函數",
        "冪次規則：",
        "例：$\\displaystyle\\int(3x^2-4x+5)\\,dx$",
        "一項一項：",
        "檢查：$(x^3-2x^2+5x)'=3x^2-4x+5$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int\\big(af+bg\\big)\\,dx=a\\!\\int\\! f\\,dx+b\\!\\int\\! g\\,dx",
        "\\int x^n\\,dx=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)",
        "=3\\cdot\\frac{x^3}{3}-4\\cdot\\frac{x^2}{2}+5x+C",
        "=x^3-2x^2+5x+C"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 乘積不能拆",
      "body": [
        "反例：$f=g=x$",
        "• 左邊：$\\displaystyle\\int x\\cdot x\\,dx=\\int x^2\\,dx=\\frac{x^3}{3}+C$",
        "• 右邊：$\\dfrac{x^2}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{x^2}{2}=\\dfrac{x^4}{4}$",
        "原因：微分的乘法規則是 $(FG)'=F'G+FG'$，不是 $F'G'$",
        "處理乘積的方法（代換、分部積分）在後面幾章",
        "今天的辦法：先乘開，變成冪次的和",
        "例：$\\displaystyle\\int\\sqrt{x}\\,(x+1)\\,dx$",
        "$\\sqrt x=x^{1/2}$，乘開：$x^{3/2}+x^{1/2}$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int f(x)g(x)\\,dx\\ \\ne\\ \\int f\\,dx\\cdot\\int g\\,dx",
        "=\\frac{x^{5/2}}{5/2}+\\frac{x^{3/2}}{3/2}+C",
        "=\\frac25x^{5/2}+\\frac23x^{3/2}+C"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 試一題",
      "body": [
        "先化簡、再積的常見樣子：",
        "• 乘積：乘開，例 $(x+1)^2=x^2+2x+1$",
        "• 分式（分母一項）：逐項除",
        "• 根號：寫成分數次方",
        "化簡之後，每一項都是 $ax^n$，就能套冪次規則"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 唯一的例外：$\\frac{1}{x}$",
      "body": [
        "冪次規則在 $n=-1$ 不能用：$\\dfrac{x^0}{0}$ 沒有意義",
        "誰的導數是 $\\dfrac1x$？$(\\ln x)'=\\dfrac1x$，但只在 $x>0$",
        "$x<0$：$\\big(\\ln(-x)\\big)'=\\dfrac{1}{-x}\\cdot(-1)=\\dfrac1x$",
        "兩邊合起來：",
        "嚴格說，$x>0$ 與 $x<0$ 是兩個區間，各自可以有不同的常數",
        "例：$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{x^2+1}{x}\\,dx$",
        "先拆開：$\\dfrac{x^2+1}{x}=x+\\dfrac1x$",
        "檢查：$\\left(\\dfrac{x^2}{2}+\\ln|x|\\right)'=x+\\dfrac1x$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int\\frac1x\\,dx=\\ln|x|+C",
        "=\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\ln|x|+C"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
      "body": [
        "• $\\int f(x)\\,dx=F(x)+C$：$f$ 的所有反導函數",
        "• 線性：加減可以拆，常數可以提出去",
        "• $\\int x^n\\,dx=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+C$（$n\\ne-1$）",
        "• 乘積、商不能拆：先乘開、逐項除、寫成冪次",
        "• $\\int\\frac1x\\,dx=\\ln|x|+C$",
        "• 答案都可以微分回去檢查",
        "下一課：基本積分表"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "workedExamples": [
    {
      "title": "逐項積分",
      "prompt": "$\\int(3x^2-4x+5)\\,dx$",
      "steps": [
        "拆成三項：$\\int 3x^2\\,dx-\\int 4x\\,dx+\\int 5\\,dx$。",
        "$3x^2\\to x^3$；$4x\\to 2x^2$；$5\\to 5x$（常數的反導函數是 $5x$，不是 $5$）。",
        "合起來，只寫一個 $C$：$x^3-2x^2+5x+C$。",
        "檢查：$(x^3-2x^2+5x)'=3x^2-4x+5$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$x^3-2x^2+5x+C$",
      "claim": "D(x^3-2*x^2+5*x) == 3*x^2-4*x+5"
    },
    {
      "title": "先拆開分式",
      "prompt": "$\\int\\frac{x^2+1}{x}\\,dx$",
      "steps": [
        "分母只有一項，可以拆給分子的每一項：$\\frac{x^2+1}{x}=\\frac{x^2}{x}+\\frac{1}{x}=x+\\frac{1}{x}$。",
        "$\\int x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}{2}$；$\\int\\frac{1}{x}\\,dx=\\ln|x|$。",
        "答案：$\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\ln|x|+C$。",
        "檢查：$\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\ln|x|\\right)'=x+\\frac{1}{x}=\\frac{x^2+1}{x}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\ln|x|+C$",
      "claim": "D(x^2/2+ln(abs(x))) == (x^2+1)/x"
    },
    {
      "title": "先乘開，再寫成冪次",
      "prompt": "$\\int\\sqrt{x}\\,(x+1)\\,dx$",
      "steps": [
        "乘開：$\\sqrt{x}\\cdot x+\\sqrt{x}=x^{3/2}+x^{1/2}$（$\\sqrt{x}\\cdot x=x^{1/2}\\cdot x^1=x^{3/2}$）。",
        "$x^{3/2}\\to\\frac{x^{5/2}}{5/2}=\\frac{2}{5}x^{5/2}$；$x^{1/2}\\to\\frac{x^{3/2}}{3/2}=\\frac{2}{3}x^{3/2}$。",
        "答案：$\\frac{2}{5}x^{5/2}+\\frac{2}{3}x^{3/2}+C$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{2}{5}x^{5/2}+\\frac{2}{3}x^{3/2}+C$",
      "claim": "D((2/5)*x^(5/2)+(2/3)*x^(3/2)) == sqrt(x)*(x+1)"
    }
